---
import InnovativeTennis from '../../../assets/newdesignimages/InnovativeTennis.png';
import '../../../../public/styles/global.css'

---

<section class="relative bg-gray-900 min-h-screen flex items-center overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1/2 flex items-center justify-center">
    <img     
      src={InnovativeTennis.src}
      alt="Innovative Tennis Equipment"     
      fetchpriority="high"
      class="max-w-full max-h-full object-contain opacity-90"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-12 relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        INNOVATIVE TENNIS<br/>
        EQUIPMENT THAT <span class="text-lime-400">SAVES TIME</span><br/>
        & <span class="text-lime-400">BOOSTS PERFORMANCE</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Tennibot offers premium ball machines and automatic ball collectors
        for players at every level. Our machines are designed for precision
        training, while our collectors eliminate time-consuming cleanup of the
        court.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-8">
        Whether you're a coach or a weekend warrior, Tennibot enhances your
        performance and optimizes your training routine. Our ball machines and
        ball collectors are available for tennis, padel, and pickleball.
      </p>
      <a href="#rover-details" class="inline-block px-6 py-2 sm:px-8 sm:py-3 border-2 border-lime-400 rounded-full text-lime-400 font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm hover:bg-lime-400 hover:text-black hover:translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 uppercase tracking-wide">
                BROWSE MODELS
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>